"test14b" README
==============

Source: node.c errexit.c

Desc:	test to add 2nd dataset after EOV mark

Invoke:	load [0] node.rx [/cfs/ctape0 [TEST01]]

Note:	* use tape TEST01 written by "test14a"
	* log is on "test14b.SLr0"
	* result is on "test14b.SRr0"
	* tape will not be unloaded automatically

Algo:	* tapealloc 
	* tdsopen for write
	* catch the negative return value from tdsopen
	* tapedealloc
